    "Public MovieLens ratings are not consented TheMovie feedback; there is no TV interaction data.",
    "This repeats an already-inspected chronological holdout and is an exploratory experiment, not a fresh independent evaluation.",
    "Only 14 validation and 30 later-window users qualify; the paired 95% NDCG-gain interval against popularity crosses zero.",
